---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Terms of Service | CC3PO Docs";
const description = "Terms of Service for CC3PO documentation and knowledge base.";
---

<Layout title={title}>
  <div class="legal-page">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: April 28, 2026</p>
    
    <div class="legal-content">
      <section>
        <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>These Terms of Service ("Terms") constitute a legally binding agreement between you and <strong>CC3PO LLC</strong>, a California limited liability company, governing your access to and use of our documentation, knowledge base, and related Services.</p>
        <p><strong>By accessing or using our Services, you agree to be bound by these Terms.</strong></p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>2. AI Services Disclaimer</h2>
        <p><strong>IMPORTANT:</strong> CC3PO utilizes artificial intelligence (AI) and machine learning technologies. You acknowledge that:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>AI-generated content, recommendations, and reports are provided for <strong>advisory and informational purposes only</strong></li>
          <li>AI outputs should not be relied upon as definitive professional advice</li>
          <li>All AI-generated recommendations should be reviewed by qualified human professionals before implementation</li>
          <li>We do not guarantee the accuracy, completeness, or reliability of any AI-generated output</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>3. Use of Documentation</h2>
        <p>This documentation is provided for informational and educational purposes. You may:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>View and read the documentation for personal or professional use</li>
          <li>Share links to specific guides with attribution</li>
          <li>Apply the knowledge to your own projects and systems</li>
        </ul>
        <p>You may not:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Copy or reproduce entire guides without permission</li>
          <li>Remove or alter copyright notices</li>
          <li>Use the documentation for commercial training without license</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>4. Service Availability</h2>
        <p>We do not guarantee uninterrupted access to our documentation:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Our Services may experience downtime, delays, or errors</li>
          <li>We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any Service at any time</li>
          <li>We are not liable for any loss resulting from Service unavailability</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>5. Payment Terms</h2>
        <p>For paid Services:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Billing:</strong> Subscription fees billed monthly in advance</li>
          <li><strong>Payment Method:</strong> Processed securely through Stripe</li>
          <li><strong>Auto-Renewal:</strong> Subscriptions automatically renew unless cancelled</li>
          <li><strong>Cancellation:</strong> Cancel anytime; takes effect at end of current billing period</li>
          <li><strong>Refunds:</strong> At our discretion. No refunds for partial months</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>6. Content Accuracy</h2>
        <p>We strive to keep documentation accurate and up-to-date. However:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Technical details may change without notice</li>
          <li>We do not guarantee all information is current</li>
          <li>Always verify with official sources before implementation</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>7. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>All software, designs, logos, trademarks, and content are owned by CC3PO LLC. You retain ownership of data you submit. You grant us a limited license to process Your Data solely to provide the Services.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>8. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>THE DOCUMENTATION AND SERVICES ARE PROVIDED "AS IS" WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. WE DISCLAIM ALL WARRANTIES, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>CC3PO shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of the Services.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>10. Indemnification</h2>
        <p>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless CC3PO LLC from claims arising from your use of the Services or violation of these Terms.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>11. Governing Law and Dispute Resolution</h2>
        <p>These Terms are governed by California law. Disputes shall be resolved through binding arbitration in Fresno County, California, per AAA rules.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>12. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>We may update these Terms at any time. Continued use constitutes acceptance of updated Terms.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>13. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>For questions about these Terms:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Email: <a href="mailto:legal@cc3po.com">legal@cc3po.com</a></li>
          <li>Website: <a href="https://cc3po.com">cc3po.com</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
    
    <div class="back-link">
      <a href="/">← Back to Knowledge Base</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 24px;
  }
  
  h1 {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  
  .last-updated {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  
  h2 {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 20px;
    margin-top: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  
  p, li {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  
  ul {
    margin-left: 24px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  
  li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  
  a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  
  a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  
  .back-link {
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
</style>
